                        "title": "1. SystemVerilog Testbench Architecture",
                        "content": "- **What is a Testbench?**\r\\n  - Testbench purpose and structure\r\\n  - DUT (Design Under Test) connection\r\\n  - Stimulus generation\r\\n  - Response checking\r\\n- **Testbench Components**\r\\n  - Testbench module\r\\n  - DUT instantiation\r\\n  - Interface instantiation\r\\n  - Clock and reset generation\r\\n  - Stimulus and monitoring\r\\n- **Key Concepts**\r\\n  - Module hierarchy\r\\n  - Signal connectivity\r\\n  - Time management\r\\n  - Event scheduling\r"
